= FAQ =

'''Q:	What effect does my pet (charmed mob or animation) have on experience gain?'''

A:	None if you are in a group. In solo play, the pet will take away 50% of the experience gained from a particular mob if, and only if, it did substantially more damage to this mob than you. For details see [[Pet Guide#Pets and Experience|Pets and Experience]]. There are ways to avoid this penalty; for detailed strategies check the Enchanter class guides, for example [[Spaid's_Solo_Guide]].


'''Q: Where can I get Tiny Daggers?

A: All cities have an Adventure Merchant that you can find using the Find Tool (default key: F). If your starting zone covers several areas (IE, Neriak), make sure to check each area to see where your Adventure Merchant is. That NPC will sell Tiny Daggers.

